      "ki_description"
      "RETIRED AS C1 PRIMARY (state.json P3 decision, 2026-08-09): -40 to +70C PP-film category temperature is out of rating at this board's 74-88C flange-adjacent operating range under 150W CW (research/components.md 'Trimmer temperature re-selection'). Kept in the tree, NOT deleted, as a documented reduced-duty alternative (fine for pulsed/low-duty use, saves $272/build-of-5 vs the Johanson 5602 primary) - do NOT wire this symbol to C1 without re-confirming duty cycle with the user. 3-33pF 250VDC PP-film trimmer, vertical, top+bottom adjust (top used). Pin 1=STATOR (single pad, RF/signal recommended). Pin 2=ROTOR (2 physical footprint pads tied together, GND recommended - keeps the tool-exposed plate grounded while tuning). See footprint descr for the full datasheet citation."
